WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.988 --> 00:00:13.549
do you mean?"

2
00:00:14.029 --> 00:00:14.909
Zann asked Fala.

3
00:00:15.289 --> 00:00:16.070
"What's happening?"

4
00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:20.832
"Early this morning a group of people marched on the palace," Fala replied.

5
00:00:20.852 --> 00:00:22.232
"What people?"

6
00:00:22.573 --> 00:00:23.153
Perda asked.

7
00:00:23.473 --> 00:00:24.473
"The Reds we freed?"

8
00:00:24.493 --> 00:00:26.334
"A few of them were there."

9
00:00:26.814 --> 00:00:27.835
Fala started pacing.

10
00:00:27.855 --> 00:00:30.176
"But the marchers were mostly non-Reds.

11
00:00:30.912 --> 00:00:34.155
They demanded that Morb leave and return the rightful king and queen."

12
00:00:34.175 --> 00:00:36.657
"What did Morb do?"

13
00:00:36.997 --> 00:00:37.597
Darb asked.

14
00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:39.199
Fala grimaced.

15
00:00:39.499 --> 00:00:41.921
"He had his trolls throw the leaders into the river.

16
00:00:43.342 --> 00:00:48.246
Then he stopped the rest of the marchers by turning the cobblestones in the courtyard into burning coals."

17
00:00:49.127 --> 00:00:52.870
"Ouch!" Zann winced, imagining the burn on his feet.

18
00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:56.072
"That put an end to the rebellion," said Fala.

19
00:00:57.093 --> 00:01:00.596
"Most citizens are staying home now and waiting to see what will happen next."

20
00:01:01.064 --> 00:01:01.625
She sighed.

21
00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:06.429
"It's been a long time since anyone in Magica had to worry about this sort of thing."

22
00:01:06.449 --> 00:01:11.453
"Everyone is probably waiting for the Red Council to rescue them," Gliss commented.

23
00:01:11.473 --> 00:01:17.518
"Too bad most of the Red Council is in Morb's dungeon somewhere on Mount Mystery," Perda said.

24
00:01:17.538 --> 00:01:23.483
"Morb announced that all Voids are invited to accept jobs as palace servants," Fala went on.

25
00:01:23.503 --> 00:01:29.308
"They'll be rewarded with amulets to provide them with enough magic to perform most daily tasks."

26
00:01:30.124 --> 00:01:34.545
"That at least doesn't sound too bad," Gliss said, shooting a look at Darb.

27
00:01:34.565 --> 00:01:36.846
"That's not all," Fala said.

28
00:01:36.866 --> 00:01:41.527
"Morb ordered all remaining free Reds to report to the palace immediately.

29
00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:44.888
Then he warned that more changes will be coming soon."

30
00:01:44.908 --> 00:01:48.849
"Like that horrible new machine Gliss told us about?"

31
00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:49.830
Perda wondered.

32
00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:52.010
"Perhaps," said Fala.

33
00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:54.211
"In any case, there's no time to waste.

34
00:01:54.991 --> 00:01:58.172
If we don't act now, Magica could be lost forever."

35
00:01:58.972 --> 00:02:00.313
"Then let's do something!"

36
00:02:00.754 --> 00:02:01.434
Zann exclaimed.

37
00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:04.477
"Should we go back to the palace and try to fight Morb?"

38
00:02:04.497 --> 00:02:06.698
"No," Fala replied.

39
00:02:06.718 --> 00:02:08.140
"I have a better idea."

40
00:02:10.001 --> 00:02:13.244
Zap! "Wow," Zann said.

41
00:02:13.264 --> 00:02:14.665
"You really did it!"

42
00:02:15.466 --> 00:02:17.127
Fala nodded, looking tired.

43
00:02:17.908 --> 00:02:21.150
She'd zapped them all from the safe house to the woods outside the city.

44
00:02:21.951 --> 00:02:22.832
Zann was impressed.

45
00:02:23.212 --> 00:02:27.555
He'd zapped himself and Darb often enough to know that it took more energy to zap two people

46
00:02:27.595 --> 00:02:27.996
than one.

47
00:02:28.672 --> 00:02:33.795
He'd never tried zapping five people and a dragon before—especially such a long distance.

48
00:02:34.495 --> 00:02:37.897
Despite not being a Red, Fala's magic was very strong.

49
00:02:37.917 --> 00:02:40.198
"Is this the right spot?"

50
00:02:40.799 --> 00:02:42.340
she asked once she'd caught her breath.

51
00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:44.481
"Yes," Darb said.

52
00:02:44.841 --> 00:02:49.684
He led the others along a trail to the large clearing, where the two cloud gliders were grazing

53
00:02:49.784 --> 00:02:52.405
peacefully. Fala stepped toward the dragons.

54
00:02:52.425 --> 00:02:55.127
"Nice beasts," she said approvingly.

55
00:02:55.147 --> 00:02:57.088
"I learned to ride on a cloud glider."

56
00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.421
"You know how to ride dragons?"

57
00:02:59.801 --> 00:03:00.381
Perda asked.

58
00:03:00.401 --> 00:03:04.663
"Sure." Fala stepped toward the larger dragon and gave it a pat.

59
00:03:04.683 --> 00:03:08.024
"I'll steer this fellow if one of you wants to take the other."

60
00:03:08.044 --> 00:03:10.365
"I'll do it," Darb volunteered.

61
00:03:10.385 --> 00:03:12.426
"Gliss, want to ride with me again?"

62
00:03:12.446 --> 00:03:14.367
"Sure," Gliss said.

63
00:03:14.387 --> 00:03:17.288
"Perda can join us, and Zann can go with Fala."

64
00:03:18.088 --> 00:03:21.390
Zann was a little disappointed that he and Perda wouldn't be riding together.

65
00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:26.212
But it was too late to say anything—everyone was already climbing onto the dragons.

66
00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:30.543
Fala's plan was to ride the dragons to Morb's fortress on Mount Mystery.

67
00:03:31.283 --> 00:03:36.226
There they would sneak in and free all the Red prisoners while Morb was busy at the palace.

68
00:03:36.247 --> 00:03:39.949
"Follow us, Zing," Zann called as the dragons took off.

69
00:03:39.969 --> 00:03:43.832
"Hold on tightly," Fala told Zann over her shoulder.

70
00:03:43.852 --> 00:03:47.754
"I want to get high up in the sky before we cross over the city."

71
00:03:48.555 --> 00:03:51.857
Zann grabbed her around the waist as their dragon flew higher and higher.

72
00:03:52.558 --> 00:03:54.179
He could hear Zing whistling behind them.

73
00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:59.542
Soon both cloud gliders and Zing were soaring high over First City.

74
00:04:00.343 --> 00:04:04.345
Zann peered down and spotted the palace almost directly below them.

75
00:04:04.365 --> 00:04:07.767
"How long will it take to reach Mount Mystery?"

76
00:04:08.127 --> 00:04:09.468
Perda called over to Fala.

77
00:04:09.488 --> 00:04:12.950
"Probably three or four hours," Fala replied.

78
00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:16.712
"We—" She was interrupted by a terrifying scream.

79
00:04:17.492 --> 00:04:21.975
An enormous purple dragon burst through a cloud and headed straight toward them.

80
00:04:21.995 --> 00:04:23.375
"Look out!"

81
00:04:23.716 --> 00:04:24.296
Darb yelled.

82
00:04:24.732 --> 00:04:26.213
"It's a thunder charger!"

83
00:04:27.294 --> 00:04:28.075
Fala gasped.

84
00:04:28.335 --> 00:04:31.258
"I think that's one of the wild dragons that disappeared from the zoo!"

85
00:04:31.598 --> 00:04:32.039
she cried.

86
00:04:32.059 --> 00:04:35.662
"Morb must be using them to guard the air above the palace!"

87
00:04:35.682 --> 00:04:37.483
"There's another one!"

88
00:04:37.924 --> 00:04:44.089
Zann exclaimed as a sleek green-and-orange beast appeared, followed by three more scary-looking dragons.

89
00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:49.894
The cloud gliders snorted with terror, doing their best to dodge the attacking wild dragons.

90
00:04:49.914 --> 00:04:51.736
"Hang on!"

91
00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.862
Fala yelled to Zann as their dragon swooped downward.

92
00:04:55.803 --> 00:04:57.284
Zann tried not to let go.

93
00:04:57.985 --> 00:05:02.809
He glanced over and saw the girls clinging to Darb, who was steering the other cloud glider through

94
00:05:02.829 --> 00:05:03.349
the attack.

95
00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:05.251
Then Zann looked down.

96
00:05:05.651 --> 00:05:08.574
The city looked much closer now, especially the palace.

97
00:05:09.374 --> 00:05:16.260
Zann nearly lost his grip as his dragon dived downward again, barely escaping the thunder charger's electrical bolt.

98
00:05:17.081 --> 00:05:20.664
Nearby Zing was weaving back and forth to avoid the bigger dragons.

99
00:05:21.684 --> 00:05:24.625
Another bolt of electricity singed the tip of Zing's wing.

100
00:05:25.405 --> 00:05:29.506
The small dragon let out a squeal of pain and attempted to fly to Zann.

101
00:05:29.526 --> 00:05:31.007
"Come on, Zing!

102
00:05:31.387 --> 00:05:32.167
You can make it!"

103
00:05:32.547 --> 00:05:33.147
cried Zann.

104
00:05:34.067 --> 00:05:38.308
Zing flew as fast as he could, desperately trying to keep up with the cloud glider.

105
00:05:39.149 --> 00:05:41.849
Once Zing was close enough, Zann put out a hand for him.

106
00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:46.331
At that exact same moment, Fala changed directions again.

107
00:05:47.151 --> 00:05:52.444
Zing quickly leaped onto the cloud glider's back, but Zann was thrown off-balance.

108
00:05:52.464 --> 00:05:58.227
He reached for Fala, but the cloud glider lurched forward to avoid another attack and Zann's hand swiped

109
00:05:58.287 --> 00:05:58.987
nothing but air.

110
00:05:59.807 --> 00:06:00.588
Zann called out.

111
00:06:00.608 --> 00:06:08.111
"Help!" By the time Fala realized what had happened, Zann was already plummeting toward the palace far below.

112
00:06:08.131 --> 00:06:10.392
"Zann!" screamed Fala.
